[
  {
    "title": "Conditional Loops",
    "tag": "LESSON 14",
    "code": "Chapter 3 · Algorithms and programming",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Conditional<br>Loops</h1><p class=\"zh\">条件循环 · 停止条件 · 逐步追踪</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Decide when repetition ends</p>",
    "note": "今天的核心不是背一段模板，而是每次能回答：先检查什么、现在是否停止、状态如何改变。衔接 L13 的固定次数循环。",
    "kind": "dark",
    "time": "0–2 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve state and repetition",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL · L10/L13",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · AAP-2.F/K",
    "html": "<p>Start with x = 2. Add 3 twice. What is x?</p><p>At x = 8, evaluate (x ≥ 8) and NOT(x ≥ 8).</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">x = 8. The comparison is true; its NOT is false.</div></details>",
    "note": "先写后说。若把赋值更新当方程，回到右侧先求值再存回；若认为NOT等于“负数”，用真假卡纠正。为停止条件取反做准备。",
    "time": "2–6 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "What you will be able to explain",
    "tag": "LEARNING TARGETS",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K · CRD-2.I/J",
    "html": "<ul><li>Trace the condition before every iteration.</li><li>Choose a stopping condition and a useful update.</li><li>Test an immediate stop, normal progress and a boundary.</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Evidence: one trace, one repaired loop and one sentinel test.</p>",
    "note": "说明本课三份证据可短但须可核查。所有例子默认按所声明的有效输入范围运行；非法输入处理不是今天额外偷偷加入的要求。",
    "time": "6–8 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "REPEAT UNTIL checks before the body",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Check the stop condition before the first and every later body execution. True exits; false runs the body then returns to the condition.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Check the stop condition before the first and every later body execution. True exits; false runs the body then returns to the condition.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 305\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"25\" width=\"260\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Initial state</text><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">first check only</text><path d=\"M275 85L350 85\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"350,85 338.0,79.0 338.0,91.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><polygon points=\"520,10 680,85 520,160 360,85\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"520\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Stop condition</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">true?</text><path d=\"M680 85L875 85\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"875,85 863.0,79.0 863.0,91.0\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"777\" y=\"61\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">TRUE</text><rect x=\"890\" y=\"25\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1040.0\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">After the loop</text><text x=\"1040.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">body is skipped</text><path d=\"M520 160L520 203\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"520,203 526.0,191.0 514.0,191.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"438\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">FALSE</text><rect x=\"365\" y=\"207\" width=\"310\" height=\"78\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"520\" y=\"239\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Run body</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"271\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">including state update</text><path d=\"M675 246H805V150H719\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M719 150L651 119\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"651,119 659.430026905401,129.4371761685916 664.4077570781138,118.51828417683424\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"911\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Recheck after body</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">The Boolean expression is the <strong>stopping condition</strong>.</p><p class=\"zh\">停止条件：true → leave the loop; false → run its body.</p>",
    "note": "官方CED AAP-2.K.5明确先检查，初始true时一次也不执行。用手沿路径走，强调false路径先执行循环体再回来检查。图的“初始状态”仅建立第一次检查所需变量，后续更新发生在循环体。不要套用某些语言的do-until后测语义。",
    "time": "8–12 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "An immediate stop can mean zero runs",
    "tag": "PREDICT",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.3/5",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\" style=\"gap:32px\"><div><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.22;padding:16px 20px;margin:14px 0\">n ← 5\nREPEAT UNTIL(n ≥ 5)\n{\n  DISPLAY(n)\n  n ← n + 1\n}\nDISPLAY(&quot;Done&quot;)</pre></div><div><p>Predict the displayed values and the number of body executions.</p></div></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Only Done is displayed. The body runs 0 times because 5 ≥ 5 is already true.</div></details>",
    "note": "完整区分循环内DISPLAY和循环后DISPLAY。学生若答5、Done，要求在第一次进入花括号前写出布尔值；不能把“循环会重复”理解为至少执行一次。",
    "time": "12–16 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A trace includes the final check",
    "tag": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\" style=\"gap:32px\"><div><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.22;padding:16px 20px;margin:14px 0\">n ← 1\nREPEAT UNTIL(n ≥ 6)\n{\n  DISPLAY(n)\n  n ← n + 2\n}</pre></div><div><table><tr><th>Check n</th><th>n ≥ 6?</th><th>Body output</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>false</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>false</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>false</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>true</td><td>none</td></tr></table></div></div><p class=\"visual-note\">Three body executions, four condition checks. Final n = 7.</p>",
    "note": "此页是讲解后的worked example，可以显示完整表。逐行同时指向DISPLAY在更新前的位置。最后true检查没有输出，检查次数不是循环体次数。说明n不必正好等于阈值。",
    "time": "16–20 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A value can jump over an exact target",
    "tag": "BOUNDARY REASONING",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Adding two to one visits odd values and skips six.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Adding two to one visits odd values and skips six.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"242.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"310.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"387.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"532.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><rect x=\"677.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">7</text><rect x=\"822.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"890.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">9</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Update: n ← n + 2</text></svg></figure><p>Which stop condition can end this sequence: n = 6 or n ≥ 6?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">n ≥ 6 stops at 7. n = 6 never becomes true for this sequence.</div></details>",
    "note": "数轴无需画不存在的6访问点。这里从1开始每次+2，始终为奇数，等于6无法达到。≥不是任何程序都自动正确，必须与“达到或超过6”的需求一致。",
    "time": "20–24 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Translate the stopping requirement",
    "tag": "PAIR PRACTICE",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A charging model starts at twenty and adds fifteen until reaching at least sixty-five.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A charging model starts at twenty and adds fifteen until reaching at least sixty-five.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Start</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">charge = 20</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Update</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">add 15 each run</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Stop goal</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">at least 65</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Write a stopping condition. Predict the body count.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">charge ≥ 65. Values after updates: 35, 50, 65, so the body runs 3 times.</div></details>",
    "note": "简化电量模型，范围与更新为本题给定，不宣称真实电池线性充电。先把at least翻译为≥，再追踪。学生如果写charge<65，这是继续条件；说明until要写结束何时成立。",
    "time": "24–28 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Progress must affect the stopping condition",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The loop condition depends on balance, so the update must make useful progress in that state.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The loop condition depends on balance, so the update must make useful progress in that state.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Condition</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">balance ≥ 10</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Relevant state</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">balance</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Body update</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">balance ← balance + 2</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Starting at balance = 0, positive updates reach the threshold.</p><p class=\"visual-note\">Updating a different variable may leave the condition unchanged.</p>",
    "note": "只说“循环里有加一”不够，必须追踪与条件相关的变量。当前例子+2保证有限次达到10；若还有输入或分支，应逐路径检查是否前进。不要把变量每次变化当作终止充分条件，例如持续远离阈值。",
    "time": "28–32 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Diagnose a loop that cannot finish",
    "tag": "DEBUG",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.4 · CRD-2.I",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\" style=\"gap:32px\"><div><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.22;padding:16px 20px;margin:14px 0\">n ← 1\nREPEAT UNTIL(n ≥ 4)\n{\n  DISPLAY(n)\n}</pre></div><div><p>What stays unchanged? Give one correction and the resulting output.</p></div></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">n remains 1. Add n ← n + 1 after DISPLAY. Then output is 1, 2, 3 and the loop stops at n = 4.</div></details>",
    "note": "先纸面诊断再运行，避免让浏览器长时间卡住。无限循环的关键是停止条件永不为true。本题新增更新的位置明确在DISPLAY之后，换位置会改变输出。",
    "time": "32–36 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "An update can move the wrong way",
    "tag": "ERROR ANALYSIS",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Decrementing from four moves away from a stop threshold of eight.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Decrementing from four moves away from a stop threshold of eight.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"242.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"310.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"387.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"532.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"677.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"822.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"890.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Stop goal: n ≥ 8; update: n ← n − 1</text></svg></figure><p>Does a changing value guarantee termination?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">No. From 4, subtracting 1 never reaches n ≥ 8. A suitable correction is n ← n + 1.</div></details>",
    "note": "使用AP课堂整数模型作推理，不引入机器整数下溢回绕。变化≠向停止目标前进。如果学生建议改条件，也需说明新条件是否满足原需求。",
    "time": "36–40 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Counted loops and conditional loops",
    "tag": "COMPARE",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A counted loop fixes a count, while a conditional loop stops when its condition becomes true.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A counted loop fixes a count, while a conditional loop stops when its condition becomes true.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"571.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.5\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">REPEAT 4 TIMES</text><text x=\"295.5\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">four body executions</text><path d=\"M586.0 103L614.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"614.0,103 602.0,97.0 602.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"619.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"571.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"904.5\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">REPEAT UNTIL</text><text x=\"904.5\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">number depends on state</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Choose a counted loop for exactly four trials.</p><p class=\"visual-note\">Choose a conditional loop for “continue until a target is reached.”</p>",
    "note": "两个面板比较控制依据，不是说一种更先进。某些程序可等价改写为两种形式，但条件循环也可能0次或永不终止。后续项目固定3个输入使用REPEAT3TIMES最直接。",
    "time": "40–44 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Write the same behavior with two loop forms",
    "tag": "TRANSFER",
    "code": "AAP-2.K · AAP-2.L",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\" style=\"gap:32px\"><div><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.22;padding:16px 20px;margin:14px 0\">REPEAT 3 TIMES\n{\n  DISPLAY(&quot;Ready&quot;)\n}</pre></div><div><p>Use a variable named count and REPEAT UNTIL to display Ready exactly three times.</p></div></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Initialize count ← 0. Stop when count ≥ 3. In the body, display Ready and then set count ← count + 1.</div></details>",
    "note": "让学生实际写完整花括号结构，答案文字仅给逻辑。检查初始化在循环外，+1在循环内。若以count1开始并以count>3结束也正确，只要三次可验证。",
    "time": "44–48 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A sentinel marks the end of input",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"An input stream contains data values four and seven followed by a minus-one stopping marker.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An input stream contains data values four and seven followed by a minus-one stopping marker.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"387.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"532.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">7</text><rect x=\"677.5\" y=\"40\" width=\"135\" height=\"95\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745.0\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">−1</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Valid data: nonnegative integers; sentinel: −1</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">The sentinel signals completion and is excluded from the total.</p>",
    "note": "哨兵值sentinel是本课实用模式，不把术语背诵作为独立官方考点。−1被保留给停止信号，因此真实数据限定非负整数。这里输入流按顺序给出，不需要列表数据结构。",
    "time": "48–52 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Read once before the first condition check",
    "tag": "TRACE",
    "code": "AAP-2.K · CRD-2.C/D",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\" style=\"gap:32px\"><div><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.22;padding:16px 20px;margin:14px 0\">total ← 0\nvalue ← INPUT()\nREPEAT UNTIL(value = -1)\n{\n  total ← total + value\n  value ← INPUT()\n}\nDISPLAY(total)</pre></div><div><p>Predict the total for inputs 4, 7, −1.<br><br>How many INPUT calls occur?</p></div></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Total = 11. Three inputs are read; the body runs twice. The sentinel is read but never added.</div></details>",
    "note": "首次INPUT让检查条件时value已经存在。体内最后一次INPUT推进到下一条数据，否则value会停在4。读入次数3与数据处理次数2分别计数。此程序假设最终提供−1；实验室输入耗尽不是正常结束信号。",
    "time": "52–58 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: test the sentinel loop",
    "tag": "LAB · 6 MIN",
    "code": "AAP-2.K · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Predict the sentinel total, step through the program, and compare actual values with the prediction.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Predict the sentinel total, step through the program, and compare actual values with the prediction.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Predict</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">expected total</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Step</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">watch value + total</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Compare</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">record evidence</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_3_Programming_Lab.html#until\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the conditional-loop lab</a></p><p class=\"small\">Test each queue: 4, 7, −1; then −1; then 0, −1.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Expected totals: 11, 0, 0. Body executions: 2, 0, 1 respectively.</div></details>",
    "note": "6分钟实验：输入框每行一个JSON数字，不把逗号序列整行粘成列表。第二组验证立即停止，第三组证明合法0会被处理，不能把0误当−1。保存至少一次逐步跟踪证据。",
    "time": "58–64 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "The last input must still be tested",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Reading the next value is followed by another condition check before any addition.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Reading the next value is followed by another condition check before any addition.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Read next value</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">after processing</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Check sentinel</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">before next body</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Stop or process</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">no sentinel addition</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A queue ending in −1 should leave total unchanged on that final read.</p>",
    "note": "用两名学生分别持value和total卡。value变−1后马上回到条件，不可以直接执行加法。若学生把更新放到循环体最上方且仍无额外判断，会把哨兵加进总和；用4,−1找反例。",
    "time": "64–68 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A test set separates different risks",
    "tag": "TEST DESIGN",
    "code": "CRD-2.J · AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\" style=\"gap:32px\"><div><ul><li>Initially true condition</li><li>One body execution</li><li>Several executions</li><li>A value crossing a boundary</li></ul></div><div><p>For n ← 5, update n ← n + 2, stop at n ≥ 6, predict the body count and final n.</p></div></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">One body execution; final n = 7. This tests crossing the threshold without landing on 6.</div></details>",
    "note": "四类测试服务不同风险。不是只挑“看起来正常”的3个值。要求在每个测试旁写expected，跑出来后才能比较actual。这个小题没有DISPLAY，问最终状态避免混淆。",
    "time": "68–72 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Original AP-style check: select TWO",
    "tag": "CHECK",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.4/5",
    "html": "<p>Which TWO statements describe AP REPEAT UNTIL?</p><ul><li>A. A true initial condition can skip the body.</li><li>B. The body must execute at least once.</li><li>C. A condition that stays false can cause an infinite loop.</li><li>D. Any variable change guarantees termination.</li></ul><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">A and C. B ignores the pre-check. D does not show that the stopping condition will be reached.</div></details>",
    "note": "独立40秒、同桌辩护1分钟，再展开。要求准确选择两项，题为原创AP-style而非真题。错B回第5页，错D回第11页。",
    "time": "72–76 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Translate a plain-language algorithm",
    "tag": "BUILD",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K",
    "html": "<p>A model starts with level = 3. Repeatedly add 4 until the level is at least 15. Then display the final level.</p><p class=\"small\">Write AP-style pseudocode and predict the result.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Initialize level ← 3. Use REPEAT UNTIL(level ≥ 15), update level ← level + 4 inside it, and DISPLAY(level) after it. The final display is 15.</div></details>",
    "note": "此题完整顺序与输出位置均需学生确定。体内轨迹7,11,15，初始3的条件false。若学生display放体内，会输出多个值不符合“then final level”。",
    "time": "76–80 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Explain why the program ends",
    "tag": "EXPLAIN",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A termination explanation connects the initial state, the repeated update and a reachable stopping condition.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A termination explanation connects the initial state, the repeated update and a reachable stopping condition.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Initial state</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">level = 3</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Progress</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">+4 per body</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Stopping state</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">level ≥ 15</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Use the specific variable, update and condition in your explanation.</p>",
    "note": "参考解释：从3每次加4，在三次更新后到15，条件true，所以停止。避免空泛“因为用了until”“因为电脑会停”。这是可读推理，不要求形式化终止证明术语。",
    "time": "80–84 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Save a short debugging record",
    "tag": "RECORD",
    "code": "CRD-2.I/J",
    "html": "<ul><li>Original prediction and the actual trace</li><li>The condition or update you changed</li><li>A test showing the intended behavior</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Homework: 12 original questions, 30 teacher marks.</p>",
    "note": "让学生从本课一个实际误差或给定错误挑例子，不编造自己未做的修改。记录哪一行、为何改、用什么测试能显示差异。已全对者用第10页缺更新程序作为给定修复对象。",
    "time": "84–87 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket",
    "tag": "EXIT",
    "code": "AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<p>1. When can the body run zero times?<br>2. From n = 1 with +2, why is n = 6 a bad stop test?<br>3. For data 0 then sentinel −1, how many body runs?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. The stopping condition is initially true.<br>2. The sequence visits odd values and never reaches 6.<br>3. One body execution. Zero is valid data.</div></details>",
    "note": "每项1分。第1项若仍错误，下课前用true卡实际挡在循环体前重走；第2项需要不能达到6的理由；第3项检验是否把0当停止值。作为进入随机重复试验的前置检查。",
    "time": "87–90 min"
  }
]
